From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 06:27:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/27] scenes: pixel plugin scene for Host API 3 (surface,
 touch, keyboard, Back)

Show a pixel plugin full screen below the status bar: size the surface to
the physical pixels, show presented frames as an ARGB8888 image refreshed
with the display, and release slots on REFR_READY. Route up to ten touch
points (edge gestures stay AERA's), Back and CLOSE, and offer AERA's own
keyboard on KEYBOARD_SHOW, sending typed text as KEY and its height as
KEYBOARD_INSET so the plugin can keep its focused field visible.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
